# Mesh interpolation and shader uniform installed in the hand-wired agent's
# premain window after the atlas cache-reuse transformer. Their position among
# the premain transformers is not load-bearing: no other premain transformer
# touches the interpolation, shader or model serialization owners.
#
# The shader uniform hook does share one owner with a later phase: it rewrites
# the single GL3.glGetUniformLocation seam in GShader.preDraw_exe, which the
# uniform-location cache below also transforms. Phase ordering (PREMAIN vs
# HOST_RESOLVED) decides that conflict, not this file: the premain transformer
# is registered retransformation-incapable, so its output is the baseline every
# later retransformation starts from, and the uniform-location installer admits
# exactly the composed shape ShaderUniformTransformer.composedShape() derives
# from the attested reference bytes before taking the seam over.
